---
// Pillars.astro - 4 Pilares Pedagógicos con los colores de la marca
---

<section class="py-20 bg-aneley-ivory/50 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle Nature Silhouette Background Details -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40">
    <div
      class="absolute top-10 left-5 w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-aneley-yellow/10 blur-2xl"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-10 right-5 w-52 h-52 rounded-full bg-aneley-purple/10 blur-2xl"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-aneley-yellow-soft text-aneley-yellow font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-aneley-yellow-warm/60"
      >
        ✨ Fundamentos de Nuestra Comunidad
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-aneley-purple leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4"
      >
        Los Cuatro Pilares de Aneley
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed"
      >
        Cada día en nuestra escuela se sostiene sobre cuatro pilares
        indivisibles que nutren la mente, el corazón, las manos y el espíritu de
        cada estudiante.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Pilar 1: Educación Emocional Consciente (Violeta Institucional #6B2D82) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 shadow-card hover:shadow-hover border-t-8 border-aneley-purple transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <!-- Icon & Badge Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div
              class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-aneley-purple-soft text-aneley-purple flex items-center justify-center text-3xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 shadow-sm"
            >
              💜
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-sm font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-purple-soft text-aneley-purple"
            >
              Pilar 01
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-aneley-purple mb-3 group-hover:text-aneley-purple-light transition-colors"
          >
            Educación Emocional Consciente
          </h3>

          <p class="text-smm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Acompañamiento amoroso sin etiquetas, castigos ni recompensas
            artificiales. Validamos cada emoción, enseñamos a nombrarla y
            proveemos un refugio seguro donde ser uno mismo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Micro Feature List -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-aneley-sand/40 space-y-2">
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-purple">●</span>
            <span>Espacio de calma y contención</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-purple">●</span>
            <span>Resolución compasiva de conflictos</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-purple">●</span>
            <span>Mindfulness y conciencia corporal</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 2: Conexión con la Tierra (Verde Hoja #4E9F3D) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 shadow-card hover:shadow-hover border-t-8 border-aneley-green transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <!-- Icon & Badge Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div
              class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-aneley-green-soft text-aneley-green flex items-center justify-center text-3xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 shadow-sm"
            >
              🌱
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-sm font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-green-soft text-aneley-green"
            >
              Pilar 02
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-aneley-green mb-3 transition-colors"
          >
            Conexión con la Tierra
          </h3>

          <p class="text-smm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Huerto propio, permacultura y contacto diario con la generosa tierra
            del Valle de Limache. Los niños siembran, cuidan, cosechan y
            comprenden los ciclos de la vida de primera mano.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Micro Feature List -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-aneley-sand/40 space-y-2">
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-green">●</span>
            <span>Huerto bio-intensivo y compostaje</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-green">●</span>
            <span>Aulas vivas bajo la sombra de árboles</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-green">●</span>
            <span>Botánica práctica y ecología local</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 3: Autonomía y Amor por el Saber (Amarillo Girasol #F5A623) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 shadow-card hover:shadow-hover border-t-8 border-aneley-yellow transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <!-- Icon & Badge Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div
              class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-aneley-yellow-soft text-aneley-yellow flex items-center justify-center text-3xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 shadow-sm"
            >
              🌻
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-sm font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-yellow-soft text-aneley-yellow"
            >
              Pilar 03
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-aneley-yellow mb-3 transition-colors"
          >
            Autonomía y Amor por el Saber
          </h3>

          <p class="text-smm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Aprender explorando, al ritmo propio y con curiosidad genuina.
            Guiamos hacia la autodisciplina interna, el pensamiento reflexivo y
            la preparación académica sin angustia.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Micro Feature List -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-aneley-sand/40 space-y-2">
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-yellow">●</span>
            <span>Preparación exámenes libres MINEDUC</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-yellow">●</span>
            <span>Proyectos guiados por intereses reales</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-yellow">●</span>
            <span>Aprendizaje multisensorial y juego</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 4: Comunidad y Familias (Rosa Fucsia Mariposa #E84382) -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl p-7 shadow-card hover:shadow-hover border-t-8 border-aneley-pink transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between"
      >
        <div>
          <!-- Icon & Badge Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div
              class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-aneley-pink-soft text-aneley-pink flex items-center justify-center text-3xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 shadow-sm"
            >
              🦋
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-sm font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-pink-soft text-aneley-pink"
            >
              Pilar 04
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-aneley-pink mb-3 transition-colors"
          >
            Comunidad y Co-Crianza
          </h3>

          <p class="text-smm text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            "Para criar a un niño hace falta una aldea entera". Escuela y
            familias tejen una alianza indestructible basada en la confianza, el
            diálogo permanente y la colaboración activa.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Micro Feature List -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-aneley-sand/40 space-y-2">
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-pink">●</span>
            <span>Asambleas abiertas de comunidad</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-pink">●</span>
            <span>Talleres y mingas colaborativas</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-aneley-text"
          >
            <span class="text-aneley-pink">●</span>
            <span>Crianza respetuosa y empática</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
